<title>EU: EP DEBATES FUTURE OF KONVER PROGRAMME AFTER 1999.</title>
<headline>EP DEBATES FUTURE OF KONVER PROGRAMME AFTER 1999.</headline>
<text>
<p>EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT SESSION NEWS PRESS RELEASE</p>
<p>DOCUMENT DATE: JULY 15, 1997</p>
<p>*</p>
<p>Future of the KONVER programme after 1999</p>
<p>*</p>
<p>Tuesday, 15 July - Gary Titley (Greater Manchester West, PES) asked about the future of the KONVER programme and emphasised its importance in certain regions. Commissioner Monika Wulf-Mathies stated that this issue would be addressed in the Agenda 2000 announcement by President Santer tomorrow. END OF DOCUMENT</p>
</text>
